printing.invalid = Useto lokushicilela okanye imilinganiselo yomfanekiso ayisebenzi.
printing.limit = Umsebenzi wokushicilela udlula umda: imifanekiso engama-200, iipikseli ezizigidi ezingama-40 / iipikseli ezingama-32768 kwicala ngalinye lomfanekiso ngamnye, okanye i-256 MiB yedatha ye-PDF ecinezelweyo.
printing.profile_error = Lo mfanekiso uneprofayili yombala engasebenziyo, engahambelaniyo okanye engaxhaswayo. I-CMYK/Lab yemveli ifuna iprofayili efakelweyo esebenzayo; i-RGB ifuna iprofayili ye-RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Umfanekiso kwi-DPI yoxwebhu lwawo awungeni kule seli. Sebenzisa imowudi yokulinganisa, igridi encinane okanye iphepha elikhulu.
printing.caption_limit = Inkcazo yomfanekiso inde kakhulu kule gridi. Sebenzisa imiqolo okanye iikholamu ezimbalwa, yenza inkcazo ibe mfutshane okanye ucime iinkcazo.
printing.font_error = Akukho fonti ifumanekayo yenkcazo yomfanekiso. Faka ifonti yokubhaliweyo okanye ucime iinkcazo.
printing.no_document = Vula uxwebhu okanye ukhethe iifoto kwigalari ngaphambi kokushicilela.
printing.source_error = Ifoto ekhethiweyo, ifayile esecaleni ehleliweyo okanye inkcazo ayifundekanga. Akukho PDF igciniweyo.
printing.save_error = Akukwazekanga ukugcina i-PDF. Khetha igama elitsha lefayile kwifolda evumela ukubhala; iifayile esele zikho azitshintshwa.
printing.downloaded = I-PDF ikhutshelwe. Yivule kwisibonisi se-PDF ukuze uyishicilele nge-100%.
